Add sample preview in track sound selector.

When hovering over or clicking a sample in the selector dropdown,
play a preview of that sample.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Hovering or clicking a sample in dropdown triggers audition
- [ ] Preview stops when moving to next item or closing dropdown
- [ ] Preview uses audition system (not track slot)
- [ ] No audio glitch when previewing rapidly

## Test Plan
- [ ] Open selector, hover over samples, verify preview plays
- [ ] Close dropdown, verify preview stops
- [ ] Rapid hover across items, verify no crash or glitch
